cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use combolite-core in your research or software, please cite it as below."
title: "combolite-core: a crash-safe embeddable multi-model C99 database engine"
abstract: >-
  combolite-core is a pure C99, crash-safe, embeddable multi-model database engine
  (document, table, vector, time-series, and graph-link models with full-text search
  and a CMBQL query language), designed around a no-heap, caller-owned-buffer memory
  model for host and microcontroller profiles.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The combolite-core contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gorovehq/combolite-core"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - database
  - embedded
  - C99
  - multi-model
  - vector-database
  - time-series
